cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Attribute Condition Queries without Code Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  A TypeScript library for query builders of web maps and data catalogues: conditions on the fields of records
  (text, numbers, dates, yes/no) joined with AND and OR, evaluated as data without eval, read back as a sentence with
  brackets in English or Greek, checked with messages for the person, and carried in a URL.
authors:
